  "description": {
   "en": "Imagine a world with consequences where the gods are held to a standard. After the Tournament of Power has determined that the universes are righteous enough to continue existing, the Grand Zenos have decided to continue with universal reform. With the universal mortal rating at an all time low, it is time for a Termination Announcement. One of the Gods of Destruction will be forced to step down. His replacement? Son Goku!\n\nAll of the gods and even our hero are shocked and opposed to this decision, but Zeno has made his choice. Goku will become the new God of Destruction whether he wants to or not. Even worse, a group of villains from outside the multiverse have determined that now is the perfect time to strike and all angels, gods, and even a group called the Celestial Guardians must now fortify and fight them to prevent the Zenoverse from being conquered! How will our hero deal with these new problems on the latest episode of Dragon Ball Hakai?!"
  },
